# What building the callers by hand leaves here; the tests (CallerTests) build in
# artifacts/test-run/callers/ instead. Rust's Cargo.lock is kept: a program's lock file belongs in
# the repository, and the tests build with --locked.
rust/target/
zig/.zig-cache/
zig/zig-out/
go/crc32c-caller
go/crc32c-caller.exe
cpp/crc32c-cpp
cpp/crc32c-cpp.exe
python/build/
python/dist/
python/src/*.egg-info/
# The library is copied next to the package's code only to build a wheel (python/README.md).
python/src/crc32c_asm/libcrc32c.so
python/src/crc32c_asm/libcrc32c.dylib
python/src/crc32c_asm/crc32c.dll
